    {
      "id": "bridge-class-notes",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Bridge Contract",
      "position": {
        "x": 80,
        "y": 100
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 300,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Bridge Node Class\n\nA bridge is a visible capability boundary, not an anonymous plumbing box.\n\n- **Import bridges** grant bounded authority to use a referenced resource in the focused graph.\n- **Export bridges** publish an explicitly described resource boundary.\n- The class owns editor, detail, summary, and icon views.\n- Twilite supplies the far-zoom dot from the bridge type badge unless a future class override is declared.\n- Presentation falls back from detail to summary to icon to the system dot.\n\nBridge authority, role, resource kind, scope, target, grants, and exposure remain inspectable.",
        "title": "Bridge Contract",
        "visibilityRole": "browser"
      },
